cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use keyaudit, please cite it as below."
title: keyaudit
abstract: >-
  Calibrated estimates of benchmark answer-key error rates from panels of model
  responses, with a ranked list of suspect items, validated against human relabels
  (MMLU-Redux, Platinum) and with explicit identifiability limits.
type: software
authors:
  - name: keyaudit contributors
repository-code: "https://github.com/h-a-forster/keyaudit"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - llm evaluation
  - benchmark label errors
  - item response theory
  - prediction-powered inference
